-- l4 deploy of a file with one @export that can be sent and one that cannot
-- (DEADWOOD): it is uploaded only to a service that says it leaves such an
-- export out ("refused-exports"), and refused locally otherwise.

@export Double a number
GIVEN m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`double` m MEANS m * 2

@export Apply twice
GIVEN f IS A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO NUMBER
      n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`apply twice` MEANS f (f n)
